        <h2 class="split__title rv" id="s1-title">API Security Testing for Web and Mobile Applications</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="split__body prose">
        <p class="rv">APIs connect web applications and mobile platforms with backend systems and third-party services, making their security critical for protecting business data. At CipherTrivia, our API Security Testing Services focus on identifying vulnerabilities that could expose sensitive information or allow unauthorized access to application resources.</p>
        <p class="rv">Through API Vulnerability Assessment and API Penetration Testing, we evaluate authentication and access controls along with input validation and data protection mechanisms. Our testing helps uncover security gaps and potential attack paths while providing actionable remediation recommendations that support secure API operations and reduce business risks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

