<section class="section section--paper" id="types" aria-labelledby="s2-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s2-title">Our Range of API Security Testing Services</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">CipherTrivia offers specialized API Security Testing Services to help businesses identify vulnerabilities and protect application interfaces from unauthorized access and data exposure. Our assessments cover API endpoints and authentication mechanisms along with access controls and data handling practices to uncover security gaps across web applications and mobile platforms.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="ledger">
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("radar") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">API Vulnerability Assessment</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our API Vulnerability Assessment identifies security weaknesses in API endpoints and configurations along with authentication and access controls. Findings are classified by severity to help development teams prioritize fixes and reduce exposure to common API attacks.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("target") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">API Penetration Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Through authorized attack simulations, our API Penetration Testing evaluates how attackers could exploit identified weaknesses. Testing focuses on broken access controls and authentication flaws along with data exposure and business logic vulnerabilities.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("identity") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">API Authentication and Authorization Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We examine how APIs verify user identities and control access to protected resources. This helps uncover weak authentication mechanisms and permission gaps that could allow unauthorized users to access restricted data or functions.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("eye-off") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">API Data Exposure and Privacy Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our testing identifies APIs that reveal sensitive information through responses or improper data handling. We assess how personal and business data is accessed and transmitted to uncover weaknesses that could lead to data leaks.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("api") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">REST and GraphQL API Security Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">REST and GraphQL APIs are assessed for weaknesses in endpoint access and request handling along with input validation and data exposure. The testing approach is adapted to the API architecture and its specific security requirements.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("sliders") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">API Configuration and Security Controls Review</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We review API configurations and security settings to identify unnecessary exposure and insecure defaults along with missing protections. The findings help teams improve API access restrictions and reduce avoidable security risks.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("gauge") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">API Rate Limiting and Abuse Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our assessment checks how APIs handle repeated requests and attempts to misuse application functions. We identify weaknesses in rate limiting and resource controls that could increase the risk of service disruption or automated abuse.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("badge") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">API Security Compliance Assessment</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We assess relevant API security controls against recognized guidance such as the OWASP API Security Top 10. This helps organizations identify gaps in their security practices and prioritize improvements based on application risks and applicable requirements.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

