<!-- COMMON VULNERABILITIES                                               -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s4-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s4-title">Common Vulnerabilities Our API Security Testing Services Find</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">APIs connect websites and mobile apps with business systems and databases, allowing information to move between different platforms. If these connections are not properly secured, attackers may gain unauthorized access or expose sensitive information. Our API Security Testing Services identify these weaknesses through API Vulnerability Assessment and API Penetration Testing, helping businesses understand their security risks and take corrective action.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="triggers">
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("unlock", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Weak Authentication and Access Control</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We identify weaknesses in how APIs verify users and manage permissions. These issues could allow unauthorized people to access accounts or view information they should not be able to see.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("database", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Sensitive Data Exposure</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Our API security assessment checks for situations where APIs reveal confidential information such as customer details or business records. We identify gaps in data protection that could lead to privacy breaches.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("users-cross", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Unauthorized Access to Records</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We test if users can access or modify another person's information by changing a request or using an account with limited permissions. These vulnerabilities can expose private records or allow unauthorized changes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("syringe", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Input Validation and Injection Flaws</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Our API Penetration Testing checks how APIs handle information submitted by users. Poor input validation can allow harmful requests to interfere with application operations or expose stored business data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("bolt", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Missing Rate Limits and Request Abuse</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We check if APIs allow too many requests within a short period. Without proper limits, attackers may overload services or repeatedly attempt to access protected features, affecting application availability and performance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("gear", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Insecure API Configuration</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Our testing identifies security settings that may leave API endpoints unnecessarily exposed. Examples include weak security controls and unnecessary access permissions that could increase the risk of unauthorized access.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("flowchart", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Business Logic Vulnerabilities</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We examine how APIs handle important business activities such as payments and account updates. Flaws in these processes could allow users to bypass restrictions or perform actions that should not be permitted.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("key", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Weak API Key and Token Protection</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Our API Vulnerability Assessment checks how access keys and authentication tokens are stored and managed. Exposed or poorly protected credentials could allow attackers to impersonate legitimate users or access restricted services.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

